    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Grew up in the chop-shop chrome trade.</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> choose 2 of: Cybertech, Repair, Streetwise.</p><p><strong>Perk:</strong> one Perk (suggested: crafting).</p><h5>Inciting Incident</h5><p>Roll or choose a d6 Inciting Incident - the event that pushed you into the run economy:</p><ol><li>1 - A run went wrong: you were the one who got out, or the one who got blamed.</li><li>2 - A corp betrayal: the employer you trusted sold you out or cut you loose.</li><li>3 - A debt came due: a favor, a loan, or a mistake put you on the hook.</li><li>4 - The Veil touched you: a brush with the Dark One's agents, a haunting, a mark.</li><li>5 - The body changed: a mutation surfaced, chrome rejected, or a decay set in.</li><li>6 - Someone was taken: a person you loved vanished, was killed, or was disappeared.</li></ol><p><em>If your rolled incident predates this Career, treat it as the break that ended your old life and started the one this Career describes.</em></p>",
      "director": ""
    },
